OL,3,ACNN, MS NOW and Politico to file
OL,4,Alawsuit against Trump's White House ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a joint statement on Monday, they
OL,7,Fsaid they were pursuing legal action to
OL,8,F"protect our First Amendment rights and
OL,9,Fdefend the principle that the
OL,10,Fgovernment does not decide what the
OL,11,Fpress reports".
OL,13,FPosting on Truth Social shortly after,
OL,14,FTrump said the White House was not
OL,15,F"instituting an assault on the Free
OL,16,FPress" and that he was targeting "FAKE
OL,17,FNEWS".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
